WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.130
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.400 --> 00:06.401
[This drama is intended for entertainment purposes only.]

3
00:06.411 --> 00:08.400
[All characters, behaviors, locations, and events depicted are fictional.]

4
00:08.430 --> 00:09.950
[It is not intended to be sexually suggestive or to encourage viewers]

5
00:10.000 --> 00:11.501
[to engage in inappropriate or morally objectionable behavior.]

6
00:11.511 --> 00:12.890
[Nor is it intended to discredit any profession]

7
00:12.899 --> 00:13.900
[or create negative perceptions of any organization]

8
00:13.911 --> 00:14.912
[or any particular group of people.]

9
00:15.070 --> 00:17.800
Tell whoever hired you that you got the job done.

10
00:17.871 --> 00:19.040
I'll play along.

11
00:19.072 --> 00:20.547
You need to go to the police right now.

12
00:20.600 --> 00:22.520
About both what happened to you and your sister.

13
00:22.601 --> 00:24.320
Even if I report it, the police won't do a thing.

14
00:24.430 --> 00:26.360
The only way to lure a tiger out of its den

15
00:26.431 --> 00:27.720
is to provoke it until it gets angry

16
00:27.795 --> 00:29.360
and comes charging out so we can catch it.

17
00:29.438 --> 00:30.774
And how are you going to provoke her

18
00:31.039 --> 00:32.800
into sending someone after you again?

19
00:32.992 --> 00:35.200
I'll do exactly what Mutta did.

20
00:35.302 --> 00:37.880
Let's have some fun after the event, okay?

21
00:37.903 --> 00:39.960
After the event, we're going all out.

22
00:41.987 --> 00:45.040
Oh, I wasn't aware that the minister would be joining us.

23
00:45.112 --> 00:47.720
In that case, may I invite Minister Nopnapha

24
00:47.955 --> 00:50.500
to present the token of appreciation to Director Jenphop?

25
00:50.956 --> 00:53.360
Look at them posing together. A husband and his two wives!

26
00:53.907 --> 00:57.308
Honesty is one of our core values.

27
00:57.411 --> 00:59.700
We must never steal someone else's spouse.

28
00:59.886 --> 01:02.160
Looks like our plans for tonight are off, Director.

29
01:02.182 --> 01:03.400
I'll be going now.

30
01:05.451 --> 01:08.080
Mutta. So how about we have a civilized conversation?

31
01:08.112 --> 01:09.320
I'll count

32
01:09.531 --> 01:11.320
how many words we can exchange before things turn ugly.

33
01:11.332 --> 01:12.333
Mutta, you bitch!

34
01:26.741 --> 01:28.139
Hello. Have you got a table yet?

35
01:28.166 --> 01:29.167
Yes, I have.

36
01:44.560 --> 01:45.761
We finally get to see each other.

37
01:46.040 --> 01:48.680
I've only seen you on video calls. Your face looked so tiny.

38
01:48.774 --> 01:51.270
You're much bigger in person than you used to be.

39
01:52.075 --> 01:53.076
Oh, come on.

40
01:53.734 --> 01:55.440
Aren't we the same size?

41
01:56.523 --> 02:00.520
When we were kids, we could share all our clothes and shoes.

42
02:01.056 --> 02:03.500
Oh, by the way, I brought something back for you.

43
02:08.179 --> 02:09.180
What is it?

44
02:11.400 --> 02:12.840
Something I took from you.

45
02:26.798 --> 02:28.760
That was 20 years ago.

46
02:29.912 --> 02:31.064
You still haven't forgotten about it?

47
02:36.395 --> 02:40.250
I have dozens of pairs of designer shoes now.

48
02:41.611 --> 02:43.680
I'm not holding a grudge over something from our childhood anymore.

49
02:55.110 --> 02:58.400
I'm here to have dinner with my twin sister, whom I haven't seen in ages.

50
02:59.264 --> 03:01.560
We'll have steak and wine.

51
03:02.352 --> 03:05.280
Maybe we'll get some dessert afterward.

52
03:07.024 --> 03:08.025
Is it okay?

53
03:11.110 --> 03:14.680
It says the speaker is happy and relaxed.

54
03:14.731 --> 03:17.720
"Her voice sounds hopeful. It's a bright day for her."

55
03:18.432 --> 03:20.040
So, how accurate is it?

56
03:20.486 --> 03:22.120
It's an AI that analyzes people's voices.

57
03:22.246 --> 03:24.560
I'm working on getting it to detect lies.

58
03:26.550 --> 03:29.403
Your work is so cutting-edge.

59
03:30.224 --> 03:32.120
No wonder you make so much money.

60
03:32.550 --> 03:35.010
You can even afford to buy land in Khao Yai.

61
03:36.022 --> 03:38.023
But the stress is just as high.

62
03:38.390 --> 03:41.120
Oh, by the way, our house plans are ready.

63
03:41.195 --> 03:43.000
I had an architect friend design them for us.

64
03:52.043 --> 03:53.044
They're so cute.

65
03:54.843 --> 03:56.726
Just like the houses we used to draw as kids.

66
03:57.728 --> 04:00.240
I've already contacted a construction company, too.

67
04:00.576 --> 04:02.500
They can start laying the foundations next month.

68
04:02.720 --> 04:05.560
I told them to build both houses at the same time.

69
04:05.622 --> 04:07.958
Don't worry. I'll cover your share for now.

70
04:09.019 --> 04:10.928
Hey, you can't do that!

71
04:12.272 --> 04:13.880
Just go ahead and build yours first.

72
04:14.643 --> 04:16.120
I've almost saved up enough money.

73
04:16.800 --> 04:18.520
I can build mine later.

74
04:19.144 --> 04:22.718
I'm thinking of selling all my designer stuff.

75
04:23.598 --> 04:24.835
That should get me another...

76
04:25.726 --> 04:26.727
Million baht.

77
04:28.099 --> 04:30.920
I had no idea Thai civil servants were paid so well.

78
04:31.166 --> 04:33.250
No wonder you have so many luxury items.

79
04:35.622 --> 04:37.760
My government salary alone

80
04:38.265 --> 04:40.560
would barely cover this meal.

81
04:41.947 --> 04:44.050
But the reason I've managed to save up

82
04:47.211 --> 04:48.212
is that my boyfriend supports me financially.

83
04:50.304 --> 04:51.305
Your boyfriend?

84
04:51.805 --> 04:54.480
You have a boyfriend? You've never told me about him!

85
04:54.918 --> 04:55.919
Let me see.

86
04:56.312 --> 04:57.313
Show me a picture of him.

87
06:22.472 --> 06:25.662
Turn off the lights and CCTV cameras on the entire floor.

88
06:30.480 --> 06:32.678
With gold prices soaring past 70,000 baht per baht-weight,

89
06:34.496 --> 06:38.250
smart people make money trading stocks and Bitcoin.

90
06:39.347 --> 06:41.294
But a brainless woman like you

91
06:41.579 --> 06:44.250
still makes a living in the world's oldest profession.

92
06:45.998 --> 06:47.320
No investment required, right?

93
06:48.000 --> 06:50.401
You've had the tools of the trade since birth.

94
06:52.347 --> 06:53.450
All it takes is a little effort.

95
06:54.342 --> 06:56.960
Just a few pelvic muscle squeezes, and the job's done.

96
06:58.200 --> 06:59.601
You're absolutely pathetic.

97
07:00.856 --> 07:03.955
Because half the men in the world are still sick of their wives.

98
07:04.968 --> 07:06.702
And I happen to have certain qualities

99
07:08.000 --> 07:10.040
that an old wife like you just doesn't have.

100
07:10.726 --> 07:13.152
Why wouldn't I seize this market opportunity?

101
07:13.894 --> 07:15.200
The money's pretty good, too.

102
07:18.662 --> 07:19.663
You bitch, Mutta!

103
07:20.663 --> 07:21.764
Take that ring off right now!

104
07:27.211 --> 07:29.960
Your husband put it on my finger himself.

105
07:30.829 --> 07:31.900
Why don't you get him to take it off?

106
07:32.718 --> 07:34.720
Though he'd probably take all my clothes off, too.

107
07:35.374 --> 07:36.920
Because what he's got at home

108
07:38.300 --> 07:39.301
isn't exactly a pretty sight.

109
07:41.283 --> 07:42.400
Take it off right now!

110
07:49.320 --> 07:50.500
You bitch, Mutta!

111
07:57.806 --> 07:59.920
Remember this. From now on,

112
08:00.755 --> 08:02.200
you're Mutta's victim.

113
08:30.100 --> 08:32.000
Oh, that wasn't enough?

114
08:32.374 --> 08:33.375
Here's another one!

115
08:57.718 --> 08:59.800
Want some more? You got it!

116
09:11.440 --> 09:13.841
I'm sorry, but you can't leave just yet.

117
09:14.179 --> 09:15.795
Huh? Why not?

118
09:16.180 --> 09:17.440
Isn't the event over?

119
09:17.736 --> 09:19.177
Uh, Director?

120
09:19.326 --> 09:20.500
Director?

121
09:31.667 --> 09:33.560
Everyone, help!

122
09:33.683 --> 09:35.000
The Director fell down the stairs!

123
09:35.763 --> 09:36.764
Ma'am!

124
09:41.515 --> 09:42.516
Ma'am!

125
09:43.691 --> 09:44.692
Ma'am!

126
09:46.694 --> 09:47.695
- Oh! - Oh my!

127
09:48.272 --> 09:49.273
Are you all right, ma'am?

128
09:50.900 --> 09:51.960
Where does it hurt?

129
09:53.100 --> 09:54.101
Aunt Nopnapha!

130
09:55.480 --> 09:56.700
- Easy now. - Nopnapha!

131
09:56.723 --> 09:57.724
Try not to move too much.

132
10:09.195 --> 10:10.680
Don't film this! Stop filming!

133
10:10.715 --> 10:11.716
No filming!

134
10:16.200 --> 10:17.201
Uh...

135
10:17.774 --> 10:20.100
I'll ask the hotel to call the Poh Teck Tung Foundation.

136
10:21.510 --> 10:22.680
You mean an ambulance, Uncle?

137
10:24.400 --> 10:25.401
I'll leave it to you, Kit.

138
10:25.771 --> 10:26.800
Please excuse us.

139
10:27.000 --> 10:30.200
Be more careful next time, Ms. Nopnapha.

140
11:24.640 --> 11:27.320
- Ma'am, could we have an interview? - Could we interview you, please?

141
11:27.500 --> 11:28.501
Just a quick interview, please.

142
11:28.688 --> 11:30.640
How are you feeling right now, ma'am?

143
11:30.902 --> 11:31.903
Well...

144
11:32.200 --> 11:35.560
Nothing's broken. Just a minor sprain.

145
11:38.064 --> 11:40.752
You're still working with a cast on?

146
11:41.065 --> 11:42.920
The work of the nation can't be put on hold.

147
11:43.066 --> 11:45.480
I'm made of steel. I can still work.

148
11:47.080 --> 11:49.840
Could you tell us how the incident happened, ma'am?

149
11:49.900 --> 11:52.080
How did you end up falling down the escalator?

150
11:53.990 --> 11:55.720
Well... It was an accident.

151
11:56.726 --> 11:58.992
I tripped over my high heels.

152
11:59.000 --> 12:01.720
And tumbled down. That's all there is to it.

153
12:02.939 --> 12:05.140
So someone happened to see you fall

154
12:05.200 --> 12:06.920
and pressed the emergency stop button, right?

155
12:08.400 --> 12:09.401
That's right.

156
12:09.700 --> 12:13.120
That young woman also works as a civil servant at this ministry.

157
12:13.800 --> 12:15.200
I owe her my thanks.

158
12:16.934 --> 12:19.880
And may I ask what happened to your face, ma'am?

159
12:20.870 --> 12:21.871
Uh...

160
12:23.300 --> 12:24.301
Well...

161
12:24.832 --> 12:26.200
I hit the handrail.

162
12:26.390 --> 12:27.920
I hit my face against the handrail right here.

163
12:28.347 --> 12:29.440
It really hurts.

164
12:32.027 --> 12:35.140
- You're bruised all over, aren't you? - It must have hurt so much.

165
13:12.960 --> 13:13.961
What did you just throw away?

166
13:16.091 --> 13:17.960
A brick. Can't you see?

167
13:18.400 --> 13:20.512
What kind of normal person carries a brick around?

168
13:21.664 --> 13:23.500
I thought only car thieves did that.

169
13:24.589 --> 13:26.656
Didn't you know I have a side hustle?

170
13:28.080 --> 13:30.280
Seriously, why are you carrying a brick?

171
13:31.445 --> 13:32.446
To stop my car from rolling.

172
13:33.500 --> 13:34.640
Can I believe anything you say?

173
13:36.000 --> 13:37.301
Why are you interrogating me?

174
13:37.422 --> 13:40.320
I'm not your suspect, Mr. Alpaca.

175
13:41.051 --> 13:42.240
Can you stop calling me Alpaca?

176
13:42.726 --> 13:43.727
Call me Al Pacino.

177
13:45.419 --> 13:46.420
Just kidding.

178
13:48.731 --> 13:49.760
I wanted to ask you something.

179
13:52.072 --> 13:53.120
What happened yesterday?

180
13:54.430 --> 13:55.431
Do you even have to ask?

181
13:55.971 --> 13:58.172
Your aunt-in-law picked a fight with me, as usual.

182
13:58.707 --> 14:00.300
But the difference is,

183
14:01.935 --> 14:03.160
this time, I fought back.

184
14:03.998 --> 14:05.300
And I'm never backing down again.

185
14:36.800 --> 14:38.201
Are we discussing work or something else?

186
14:39.835 --> 14:41.920
If it's personal, let's talk about it at home.

187
14:44.755 --> 14:48.100
Then I'll use my authority to order you to discuss personal matters with me right here.

188
14:48.664 --> 14:50.640
Since we're hardly ever home at the same time.

189
15:10.563 --> 15:12.200
Do you know what happened last night?

190
15:14.248 --> 15:15.650
Exactly what you said in the interview.

191
15:16.584 --> 15:17.680
You tripped over your heels.

192
15:21.585 --> 15:25.880
She hit me in the face with a blunt object and sent me tumbling down the stairs.

193
15:27.091 --> 15:28.592
Not just once.

194
15:28.862 --> 15:30.360
- But three times! - Hey!

195
15:31.342 --> 15:34.100
If you're going to accuse Mutta, at least make it believable.

196
15:34.390 --> 15:37.391
If she told me you attacked her, I'd believe that.

197
15:38.528 --> 15:39.880
Stop being such a fool!

198
15:40.715 --> 15:43.116
That bitch Mutta isn't as innocent as you think!

199
15:44.716 --> 15:46.840
What kind of shameless woman steals another woman's husband?

200
15:47.100 --> 15:48.801
How rotten must she be inside?

201
15:48.840 --> 15:52.320
I think you need to understand our relationship better.

202
15:53.170 --> 15:54.840
I don't love you anymore.

203
15:55.170 --> 15:57.100
So I don't belong to you.

204
15:57.814 --> 15:59.560
Mutta is the woman I love.

205
16:00.166 --> 16:01.920
I was the one who pursued her.

206
16:02.000 --> 16:03.801
She didn't steal me from you.

207
16:05.056 --> 16:06.700
She seduced you!

208
16:06.854 --> 16:08.220
That's why you fell for her!

209
16:10.307 --> 16:11.320
If she weren't in the picture,

210
16:11.500 --> 16:13.301
- Would you have stopped loving me? - Yes!

211
16:14.067 --> 16:15.080
I would've stopped loving you anyway.

212
16:15.838 --> 16:17.960
Even if you were the last woman on Earth,

213
16:18.259 --> 16:19.860
I'd rather fall in love with a man.

214
16:20.414 --> 16:22.240
Hell, I'd rather sleep with a man!

215
16:23.115 --> 16:24.483
Stop blaming other people!

216
16:24.766 --> 16:27.440
The reason I stopped loving you is because of you.

217
16:27.500 --> 16:28.560
Not anyone else.

218
16:29.574 --> 16:31.075
You can't stop loving me!

219
16:31.318 --> 16:33.219
- Because we're husband and wife! - Of course I can!

220
16:33.230 --> 16:35.400
Why can't I? I just don't love you anymore!

221
16:35.478 --> 16:37.640
Even if you killed me, I'd never love you again!

222
16:37.803 --> 16:38.804
You have to love me!

223
16:39.712 --> 16:40.960
Think carefully, Phop.

224
16:41.622 --> 16:42.880
Without me,

225
16:43.654 --> 16:45.250
you wouldn't be a director.

226
16:45.360 --> 16:47.361
You wouldn't get to sip wine and sign papers all day.

227
16:47.542 --> 16:49.840
Or take 200 days off a year and show up late.

228
16:51.120 --> 16:53.878
I could demote you to a janitor anytime I want!

229
16:55.030 --> 16:58.614
Go ahead! Do it! Think carefully, Nopnapha.

230
16:59.126 --> 17:01.360
The beloved female minister of the people.

231
17:01.392 --> 17:04.370
You think someone like you would accept having a janitor for a husband?

232
17:04.515 --> 17:06.440
I don't believe it! Go ahead!

233
17:06.547 --> 17:08.056
Do it! I'd love to be a janitor!

234
17:08.088 --> 17:09.089
Go ahead!

235
17:09.315 --> 17:12.240
Hey! Get me a mop! I want to be a janitor!

236
17:12.286 --> 17:14.387
Bring me a mop! Come on!

237
17:14.614 --> 17:15.615
Come back here right now!

238
17:26.768 --> 17:27.769
Phop!

239
17:29.440 --> 17:31.000
Calm down, ma'am. Please calm down.

240
17:31.339 --> 17:32.520
Keep it together, ma'am.

241
17:33.387 --> 17:34.388
Please calm down.

242
17:35.549 --> 17:36.550
Take a deep breath.

243
17:36.579 --> 17:37.700
Breathe in for four, out for six.

244
17:38.286 --> 17:41.480
Breathe in. One... two... three...

245
17:44.030 --> 17:47.120
Has Phop really gone this crazy over that woman?

246
17:48.696 --> 17:50.600
He already has a perfect family.

247
17:51.347 --> 17:53.600
A good wife and wonderful children.

248
17:55.416 --> 17:57.280
I'll never understand men.

249
17:59.417 --> 18:02.320
Then why haven't you fired that mistress yet, Mom?

250
18:02.814 --> 18:04.880
Isn't having an affair a serious disciplinary offense?

251
18:05.443 --> 18:06.445
If I did that,

252
18:06.776 --> 18:09.777
I'd be announcing to everyone that your father cheated on me.

253
18:13.100 --> 18:14.840
Then just frame her for something else.

254
18:15.112 --> 18:16.440
Theft, embezzlement, anything.

255
18:18.000 --> 18:19.801
We'd still have to set up an investigation committee.

256
18:20.131 --> 18:23.132
And Dad would chair it, so she'd get away with it anyway.

257
18:33.296 --> 18:34.790
If we can't fire her,

258
18:35.523 --> 18:38.360
we can make her life miserable until she quits.

259
18:38.840 --> 18:40.280
Oh, that's right!

260
18:40.510 --> 18:43.250
Oshi, you're so good at coming up with wicked ideas.

261
18:43.710 --> 18:44.979
We need to find ways to bully her.

262
18:45.288 --> 18:46.534
Make her so miserable she jumps off a building.

263
18:48.123 --> 18:49.124
No way.

264
18:49.584 --> 18:52.840
I just gave an interview about the Stop Bullying campaign in schools.

265
18:55.462 --> 18:58.050
I don't condone bullying either.

266
18:58.798 --> 19:02.120
But I'll make an exception for that bitch Mutta.

267
19:03.371 --> 19:04.372
Oshi.

268
19:05.400 --> 19:07.520
Let's hear it. What's your plan?

269
19:08.344 --> 19:11.240
Our party oversees the Ministry of Health.

270
19:12.323 --> 19:14.100
We should use that to our advantage.

271
19:30.033 --> 19:31.120
Where are you strutting off to?

272
19:31.211 --> 19:32.600
To work and look fabulous, of course.

273
19:38.891 --> 19:40.478
- What's this? - What is it?

274
19:40.603 --> 19:42.320
Is it an official memo?

275
19:43.206 --> 19:44.720
Warning and Surveillance

276
19:44.944 --> 19:48.080
Of a serious infectious disease outbreak

277
19:48.363 --> 19:50.164
that poses a threat to public health.

278
19:50.459 --> 19:51.460
What's this, Auntie?

279
19:52.123 --> 19:53.387
Whatever it is, never mind.

280
19:53.568 --> 19:55.320
But who the hell has it?

281
19:55.531 --> 19:57.600
I hope it's no one in our department.

282
20:00.360 --> 20:01.401
- Oh my God! - Oh my God!

283
20:01.832 --> 20:03.315
Oh my goodness!

284
20:03.600 --> 20:05.201
What are you two freaking out about?

285
20:05.300 --> 20:07.720
Did some scammer swindle you out of every last penny?

286
20:08.998 --> 20:11.399
Go back to your desk and read the official memo.

287
20:12.150 --> 20:13.160
What the hell is this memo about?

288
20:16.432 --> 20:18.000
Mutta Jongsawat.

289
20:18.448 --> 20:21.320
She has yellowish-green vaginal discharge

290
20:22.486 --> 20:24.720
with an unusual odor.

291
20:27.104 --> 20:29.800
She has a history of unprotected sex.

292
20:31.238 --> 20:35.360
She's been diagnosed with gonorrhea.

293
20:37.728 --> 20:39.170
That's terrifying!

294
20:40.880 --> 20:42.881
- Oh my God! - Oh my God!

295
20:43.358 --> 20:44.700
Mutta has this disease?

296
20:47.166 --> 20:48.167
Mutta, dear.

297
20:48.398 --> 20:51.040
What's this yellowish-green discharge like?

298
20:51.483 --> 20:54.100
I want to know before I go under the knife.

299
20:54.331 --> 20:57.622
Before you get your plastic surgery, why don't you get brain surgery first, Chom?

300
20:57.696 --> 20:59.344
Those hormones have really messed with your head.

301
21:00.699 --> 21:01.880
The things you ask!

302
21:02.760 --> 21:04.400
Who did this to you?

303
21:04.886 --> 21:06.360
How could anyone be so cruel?

304
21:06.539 --> 21:09.250
I can't take this. I just can't.

305
21:10.246 --> 21:11.247
Ta!

306
21:13.638 --> 21:14.720
Your department got the memo too?

307
21:17.110 --> 21:19.560
Please calm down, Ta.

308
21:20.144 --> 21:24.800
Even though you have a disgusting sexually transmitted disease,

309
21:25.345 --> 21:27.360
I'll stand by you.

310
21:27.458 --> 21:28.520
I don't have it!

311
21:31.086 --> 21:33.360
You can just say you had it and recovered.

312
21:33.902 --> 21:36.700
Lying about it is even more embarrassing.

313
21:36.720 --> 21:37.721
I won't make fun of you.

314
21:39.715 --> 21:40.880
Hey, listen.

315
21:41.779 --> 21:42.800
I'm giving everyone an order.

316
21:43.400 --> 21:45.416
No one is to bring this up again.

317
21:47.028 --> 21:48.080
I think someone's trying to frame her.

318
21:49.160 --> 21:50.661
This document is fake.

319
21:50.771 --> 21:51.772
- Huh? - What?

320
21:52.131 --> 21:53.166
- Fake? - Fake?

321
21:53.172 --> 21:56.560
But it has the Director's signature. Look!

322
21:59.651 --> 22:00.835
- Ta! - Ta!

323
22:02.947 --> 22:06.040
Everyone, does Ta have a rotten coochie?

324
22:07.840 --> 22:10.200
Then I don't want that surgery anymore.

325
22:10.241 --> 22:12.420
I'd rather stick with my jock itch.

326
22:17.371 --> 22:18.920
I had nothing to do with this.

327
22:19.600 --> 22:20.601
You see,

328
22:20.875 --> 22:22.560
there was only one page when I signed it.

329
22:23.147 --> 22:25.400
I thought it was the usual flu warning.

330
22:26.430 --> 22:27.880
So where the hell did this page come from, Kit?

331
22:28.680 --> 22:29.681
I don't know, sir.

332
22:30.483 --> 22:32.880
At first, everything seemed normal, but then this second page...

333
22:33.038 --> 22:34.160
I have no idea where it came from either.

334
22:36.571 --> 22:39.120
I'll look into it for you, Ta. It shouldn't be hard to find who's responsible.

335
22:39.291 --> 22:40.320
Do we really need to investigate?

336
22:40.700 --> 22:42.640
This is confidential medical information from a hospital.

337
22:42.752 --> 22:44.240
Not just anyone could get their hands on it.

338
22:44.830 --> 22:46.731
There's only one person with enough power

339
22:47.203 --> 22:48.530
to pull something like this off.

340
22:49.078 --> 22:50.079
Ta.

341
22:50.883 --> 22:52.044
Hey, Kit.

342
22:54.720 --> 22:56.500
Why are you always following Ta around?

343
22:57.363 --> 22:59.100
Are you her personal bodyguard or something?

344
22:59.387 --> 23:02.000
Well, if you're a director and still can't protect Ta,

345
23:02.643 --> 23:04.680
at least I can be there for her as a friend

346
23:04.830 --> 23:06.031
and give her emotional support.

347
23:06.275 --> 23:07.582
That's better than doing nothing, isn't it?

348
23:16.310 --> 23:18.680
Why is everyone staring at us?

349
23:19.035 --> 23:21.160
Let them stare. Why do you care?

350
23:21.942 --> 23:23.720
Hey, you lot!

351
23:23.963 --> 23:26.100
What the hell are you staring at?

352
23:26.280 --> 23:28.078
You don't have to look so disgusted.

353
23:28.430 --> 23:31.560
We're all perfectly clean and healthy.

354
23:31.651 --> 23:33.600
None of us has any kind of infection.

355
23:33.710 --> 23:35.960
Mutta's the only one who's infected.

356
23:36.283 --> 23:37.840
If you don't believe me, want to take a sniff?

357
23:38.800 --> 23:39.801
But...

358
23:40.101 --> 23:41.850
Aren't you all in the same department?

359
23:42.043 --> 23:44.160
Haven't you already caught it?

360
23:46.683 --> 23:47.790
Where is Meow anyway?

361
23:48.379 --> 23:49.380
Oh!

362
23:49.494 --> 23:51.560
Meow took half a day off for personal reasons.

363
23:51.600 --> 23:53.560
She's doing a part-time gig on Soi Nana.

364
23:53.952 --> 23:57.000
Didn't you learn anything in health class?

365
23:57.720 --> 23:59.721
Don't you know that just because people work together,

366
24:00.126 --> 24:01.640
it doesn't mean they're rubbing their private parts together?

367
24:02.040 --> 24:05.160
Germs can't just jump into someone's underwear.

368
24:05.544 --> 24:07.720
And you!

369
24:07.931 --> 24:10.120
You'd better watch out for the men in your department.

370
24:10.507 --> 24:14.080
Who knows? That woman might have infected them all by now.

371
24:15.000 --> 24:16.720
Oh my! In that case,

372
24:16.811 --> 24:19.760
the Director must've caught it from Ta!

373
24:20.294 --> 24:21.560
Shut your damn mouth, Chuenchom.

374
24:22.192 --> 24:23.250
Here comes the mistress.

375
24:41.262 --> 24:42.520
Um, well...

376
24:42.867 --> 24:43.868
Excuse me, everyone.

377
24:44.024 --> 24:47.960
I need to discuss something with Cha-am today.

378
24:48.107 --> 24:50.560
So I'll have lunch with them, okay?

379
24:51.275 --> 24:53.200
It's not that I'm disgusted by you, Ta.

380
24:53.446 --> 24:54.840
See you back at the office.

381
24:56.640 --> 24:57.800
Excuse me.

382
25:08.723 --> 25:09.724
Thank you.

383
25:13.198 --> 25:14.680
It's nice to have just the three of us.

384
25:15.199 --> 25:16.200
It's less chaotic this way.

385
25:17.574 --> 25:18.575
Oh!

386
25:19.200 --> 25:20.560
I just remembered something.

387
25:20.640 --> 25:22.560
Aunt Phorn wants to buy retirement insurance.

388
25:22.651 --> 25:26.050
I'd better go make a sale. See you, Ta and Veekit.

389
25:34.451 --> 25:35.960
You can make an excuse to leave, too.

390
25:36.584 --> 25:37.650
I can sit here alone.

391
25:38.579 --> 25:39.760
But I have something to discuss with you.

392
25:40.643 --> 25:41.644
Who else am I supposed to sit with?

393
25:50.443 --> 25:53.595
Ta, let's go eat somewhere else.

394
25:54.000 --> 25:55.100
I don't want people staring at me.

395
25:55.987 --> 25:57.280
Running away won't solve anything.

396
25:57.635 --> 25:59.700
The Director needs to deal with whoever did this.

397
26:13.512 --> 26:14.513
Hello, Mr. Jenphop.

398
26:14.787 --> 26:16.880
Um... She's in a meeting right now.

399
26:17.040 --> 26:19.600
It'll probably be another hour before she's done.

400
26:20.088 --> 26:21.155
Good. Let her stay in her meeting.

401
26:21.928 --> 26:23.429
I'm not here to talk to Nopnapha.

402
26:24.000 --> 26:25.120
I'm here to talk to you.

403
26:25.800 --> 26:26.801
Me?

404
26:45.027 --> 26:46.028
Hello, sir.

405
26:46.836 --> 26:48.654
You've heard about today's official memo, haven't you?

406
26:49.614 --> 26:50.680
What memo?

407
26:51.571 --> 26:53.760
I don't know anything about it. I haven't seen or heard a thing, sir.

408
26:56.654 --> 26:59.043
I've heard a little about it.

409
26:59.646 --> 27:01.880
I overheard some civil servants talking.

410
27:01.900 --> 27:02.920
How did Nopnapha manage

411
27:03.971 --> 27:06.180
to leak Mutta's medical records?

412
27:07.379 --> 27:08.440
I don't know, sir.

413
27:08.500 --> 27:10.619
Come on! Just admit she did it!

414
27:13.190 --> 27:15.360
I don't know whether she did it or not.

415
27:15.408 --> 27:17.900
You're the one who handles all her affairs.

416
27:18.094 --> 27:19.195
How could you not know?

417
27:21.731 --> 27:23.000
With all due respect, sir,

418
27:24.046 --> 27:26.086
Ms. Nopnapha is the one paying my salary.

419
27:27.464 --> 27:29.465
I can't answer questions like that.

420
27:30.691 --> 27:32.600
If that's all you wanted to ask me,

421
27:33.662 --> 27:34.840
please excuse me.

422
27:35.768 --> 27:36.769
Goodbye.

423
27:42.838 --> 27:45.339
That bitch! Trying to play dumb with me?

424
28:08.235 --> 28:09.440
Trying to trick me into talking!

425
28:10.110 --> 28:12.160
Even if you pried my mouth open with a crowbar, I wouldn't say a word.

426
28:13.030 --> 28:17.031
A loyal servant like me would never betray her boss.

427
28:23.000 --> 28:24.001
Oshi?

428
28:26.072 --> 28:27.073
Mind if I sit with you?

429
28:29.270 --> 28:30.271
Please, have a seat.

430
28:43.614 --> 28:45.200
It's really hot today, isn't it?

431
29:10.286 --> 29:11.520
Let me blow some cool air on you.

432
29:16.800 --> 29:17.801
Sure.

433
29:22.646 --> 29:25.800
There's something I'd like to ask you.

434
29:28.459 --> 29:29.600
Go ahead.

435
29:44.854 --> 29:45.855
What have you done?

436
29:49.136 --> 29:50.137
What have I done?

437
29:50.283 --> 29:53.720
That's what I'm asking! Tell me what you've done!

438
29:54.331 --> 29:56.132
What exactly did I do?

439
29:58.059 --> 30:01.400
Oshi has told me everything about the memo.

440
30:03.000 --> 30:04.120
I had no choice.

441
30:05.070 --> 30:06.121
Just think about it.

442
30:06.678 --> 30:09.920
Imagine how disgraceful it would be if the news broke

443
30:10.459 --> 30:14.120
that there was an STD outbreak in the ministry I oversee.

444
30:14.496 --> 30:15.920
Are you really a minister?

445
30:16.256 --> 30:17.787
You make it sound like this infection

446
30:17.846 --> 30:20.247
can spread through the air like COVID.

447
30:20.900 --> 30:23.600
Well, judging by Mutta's behavior,

448
30:23.700 --> 30:25.401
it probably spreads faster than COVID.

449
30:27.300 --> 30:28.440
Have you been tested yet?

450
30:29.440 --> 30:31.960
Are you the one spreading it or the one who caught it?

451
30:33.451 --> 30:34.640
I'm not infected.

452
30:37.270 --> 30:38.520
I've already been tested.

453
30:40.320 --> 30:41.321
Take a look.

454
30:44.883 --> 30:46.480
Let me warn you right now.

455
30:47.086 --> 30:49.700
Don't ever abuse your authority to hurt Mutta again.

456
30:50.040 --> 30:51.480
Or I'll make sure you pay for it.

457
30:54.011 --> 30:57.040
A department director threatening a minister?

458
30:57.926 --> 30:59.180
Am I supposed to be scared?

459
31:00.048 --> 31:01.920
What if I told you

460
31:02.371 --> 31:06.202
that from now on, I won't attend any public events with you?

461
31:08.000 --> 31:10.648
And I'll announce to the media

462
31:11.280 --> 31:12.800
that you and I

463
31:13.000 --> 31:15.840
are no longer husband and wife.

464
31:18.120 --> 31:19.121
How about that?

465
31:19.808 --> 31:20.809
Well?

466
31:21.638 --> 31:22.639
Now that I've said that,

467
31:23.392 --> 31:24.960
are you starting to get scared?

468
31:32.864 --> 31:33.865
What are you going to do?

469
31:37.238 --> 31:38.239
Na!

470
31:38.539 --> 31:40.160
- Na! - Yes?

471
31:40.395 --> 31:41.850
Move all my belongings

472
31:42.100 --> 31:43.380
into the guest bedroom.

473
31:43.718 --> 31:44.719
Yes, sir.

474
32:29.278 --> 32:30.279
Go-

475
32:30.800 --> 32:31.801
nor-

476
32:32.355 --> 32:33.356
rhea.

477
32:34.779 --> 32:35.780
- Go… - Titus!

478
32:37.814 --> 32:39.000
What disease did Dad get tested for?

479
32:40.880 --> 32:44.040
- A cold. - A cold is "cold." I go to an international school, Mom!

480
32:45.320 --> 32:47.120
If you won't tell me, I'll just ask AI.

481
32:49.283 --> 32:50.284
Titus!

482
32:58.915 --> 32:59.920
Gonorrhea.

483
33:00.163 --> 33:01.680
- Dad got tested for gonorrhea! - Titus!

484
33:55.019 --> 33:58.020
I couldn't find any medication for vaginal discharge.

485
33:58.128 --> 33:59.640
Just basic, everyday medicines.

486
33:59.902 --> 34:01.160
Why are you even looking for that?

487
34:01.428 --> 34:03.920
The point isn't whether your sister actually has it.

488
34:04.019 --> 34:06.560
It's that her private medical information was exposed.

489
34:06.856 --> 34:07.857
Because I want to know.

490
34:08.718 --> 34:10.600
I want to know what my sister's life has been like.

491
34:10.840 --> 34:12.320
I need to know every little detail.

492
34:13.715 --> 34:14.716
Suit yourself.

493
34:14.776 --> 34:15.933
I'm on your side, anyway.

494
34:16.216 --> 34:18.723
Let me know if you find anything. Maybe I can help.

495
34:25.640 --> 34:27.480
Munin, are you even listening?

496
34:28.000 --> 34:29.880
Munin! Munin!

497
34:31.000 --> 34:32.001
Hey!

498
34:33.462 --> 34:34.800
I found Ta's diary.

499
34:41.363 --> 34:43.864
So? Did she write anything in it?

500
34:44.696 --> 34:47.500
No. Nothing about this disease at all.

501
34:48.700 --> 34:49.950
I went to the hospital.

502
34:50.574 --> 34:53.720
They said their system was hacked and it wasn't their fault.

503
34:53.900 --> 34:56.520
If I want to take legal action, I'll have to report it to the police myself.

504
34:58.216 --> 34:59.217
That's so fucked up!

505
35:00.000 --> 35:02.520
How could a woman do something like this to another woman?

506
35:03.478 --> 35:05.170
It's so damn inhumane!

507
35:05.987 --> 35:07.320
I'm starting to wonder

508
35:07.864 --> 35:09.443
what else those people have done to Ta.

509
35:10.158 --> 35:12.480
Maybe Ta didn't write everything in her diary.

510
35:15.448 --> 35:18.850
Are you okay, though? People must've been gossiping about you all day.

511
35:19.500 --> 35:20.501
Yeah.

512
35:20.814 --> 35:23.440
Both behind my back and right to my face.

513
35:24.326 --> 35:27.327
I keep telling myself this isn't about me.

514
35:27.899 --> 35:29.408
But I can't help how I feel.

515
35:29.700 --> 35:32.480
I feel hurt and humiliated on Ta's behalf.

516
35:36.136 --> 35:38.500
And it makes me so damn angry!

517
35:40.712 --> 35:42.013
So how are you going to get back at them?

518
35:44.152 --> 35:45.923
Until I can do something myself,

519
35:47.153 --> 35:50.280
I'll use Jenphop to get back at that bitch.

520
35:51.955 --> 35:53.680
He just called me.

521
35:54.088 --> 35:56.120
He said he and Nopnapha are sleeping in separate rooms now.

522
35:58.563 --> 35:59.920
My next move

523
36:01.496 --> 36:03.120
is to make him divorce her.

524
36:30.264 --> 36:31.265
Ta!

525
36:33.446 --> 36:34.447
We got here at the same time!

526
36:35.189 --> 36:37.472
Really? I saw your car parked here already.

527
36:38.475 --> 36:41.200
I just parked, and then you pulled in.

528
36:43.995 --> 36:45.910
- Heading to the cafeteria? - Yeah.

529
36:46.200 --> 36:47.440
Come on, let's walk together.

530
37:19.571 --> 37:21.760
- The usual, right? - The usual, please.

531
37:22.366 --> 37:24.960
Not for me. I'll have a hot Americano.

532
37:27.963 --> 37:29.840
I didn't know you drank hot Americanos.

533
37:31.403 --> 37:33.360
There's still a lot you don't know about me, Kit.

534
37:35.285 --> 37:38.070
You'd better keep your distance from me.

535
37:38.769 --> 37:41.270
Who knows what else might come out about me?

536
37:41.723 --> 37:43.024
You'll only get dragged into it.

537
37:43.291 --> 37:44.880
Then that's all the more reason for me to stay close to you.

538
37:46.064 --> 37:48.840
How about this? I'll wait for you in the parking lot every morning.

539
37:49.131 --> 37:50.640
Then we can walk to the cafeteria together.

540
37:50.912 --> 37:52.200
And head up to the office together.

541
37:52.598 --> 37:54.240
As for lunch and after work,

542
37:54.622 --> 37:58.080
I'll pick you up at your department, and we'll leave the building together. Okay?

543
37:58.700 --> 37:59.701
No need.

544
38:00.035 --> 38:02.574
Even kindergarteners don't need someone picking them up like that.

545
38:03.331 --> 38:04.640
There's something else you don't know about me.

546
38:06.332 --> 38:07.960
I'm much stronger than you think.

547
38:16.694 --> 38:20.080
The cafeteria vendor refused to sell me coffee.

548
38:20.934 --> 38:24.560
Please tell Ms. Nopnapha that her plan to torment me worked.

549
38:25.140 --> 38:26.728
If I ever disappear again,

550
38:27.141 --> 38:28.808
you won't have to wonder why, Director.

551
38:31.374 --> 38:34.300
I have to go now. Someone else is coming to yell at me.

552
38:35.867 --> 38:39.632
Mutta, I have an announcement to make.

553
38:40.560 --> 38:44.120
We, the Organizational Relations and Activities Department,

554
38:44.400 --> 38:46.101
have voted

555
38:48.707 --> 38:50.920
to expel you from our department

556
38:51.208 --> 38:53.480
to rid ourselves of this disgrace.

557
38:54.158 --> 38:56.080
By a majority vote

558
38:56.406 --> 39:00.280
of four to three. Please leave.

559
39:01.926 --> 39:02.927
Mutta.

560
39:03.830 --> 39:06.120
I voted in your favor.

561
39:07.224 --> 39:09.720
But we really were outnumbered.

562
39:10.958 --> 39:12.800
I'll help you pack your things.

563
39:15.112 --> 39:16.113
Don't bother.

564
39:17.000 --> 39:18.001
I'm not leaving!

565
39:18.601 --> 39:19.680
How the hell am I supposed to make a living if I leave?

566
39:20.814 --> 39:23.128
And what gives you the right

567
39:23.955 --> 39:26.120
to kick someone out of the civil service?

568
39:26.440 --> 39:28.200
Because we've been affected

569
39:28.241 --> 39:30.360
by your disgusting behavior.

570
39:30.894 --> 39:32.640
If you had any sense of decency,

571
39:32.880 --> 39:34.760
you wouldn't have waited for us to vote you out.

572
39:35.182 --> 39:36.560
You should've resigned on your own.

573
39:37.518 --> 39:39.480
What are you gossiping about now?

574
39:40.547 --> 39:41.548
Get back to work.

575
39:42.915 --> 39:44.360
Hear us out, Toey.

576
39:44.558 --> 39:47.600
We're having a dispute here.

577
39:47.760 --> 39:51.240
If a decision is made by majority vote,

578
39:51.718 --> 39:53.760
shouldn't we respect the outcome?

579
39:55.334 --> 39:58.440
According to democratic principles, we should abide by it.

580
39:59.900 --> 40:01.640
Why? What's going on?

581
40:03.000 --> 40:07.201
By a majority vote of four to three,

582
40:07.747 --> 40:09.600
we've decided that Mutta must resign.

583
40:10.574 --> 40:13.027
Please certify the results, Toey.

584
40:18.926 --> 40:21.512
So, who voted for Mutta to stay?

585
40:22.125 --> 40:24.392
The votes were almost evenly split.

586
40:24.589 --> 40:27.920
The voters are Hong, Chuenchom and I.

587
40:28.000 --> 40:30.662
But we're still one vote behind, Toey.

588
40:35.462 --> 40:37.000
You can count my vote, too.

589
40:38.366 --> 40:42.000
Oh! Then that means the votes are now tied!

590
40:42.037 --> 40:43.842
Four to four!

591
40:44.024 --> 40:46.440
Mutta, you can stay.

592
41:13.144 --> 41:14.145
Uncle.

593
41:14.606 --> 41:15.607
What?

594
41:20.422 --> 41:21.423
I lost!

595
41:22.200 --> 41:23.201
What?

596
41:23.500 --> 41:25.510
Here's the quotation for a mobile STI testing unit.

597
41:26.272 --> 41:29.200
I've selected only sexually transmitted infections, including

598
41:30.547 --> 41:34.179
gonorrhea, syphilis, HPV, and HIV.

599
41:38.000 --> 41:39.001
Whoa!

600
41:40.416 --> 41:41.931
Why is it so expensive?

601
41:43.600 --> 41:44.601
Look,

602
41:45.494 --> 41:48.118
there's no need to make such a big deal over just Mutta.

603
41:48.939 --> 41:50.240
I'll take her to get tested myself.

604
41:50.779 --> 41:52.107
That won't work, Uncle.

605
41:52.411 --> 41:55.000
It happened here, and the rumors spread here.

606
41:55.454 --> 41:56.800
If we take Ta somewhere else for testing,

607
41:57.160 --> 41:59.920
the people trying to frame her might claim the results are fake.

608
42:00.910 --> 42:04.400
Ta needs to be tested here to clear up any doubts.

609
42:06.467 --> 42:08.640
- But we can't afford it with this year's budget! - Why don't you cut

610
42:09.078 --> 42:10.920
the overseas trip budget by about 3%, Uncle?

611
42:12.088 --> 42:14.400
We'd have enough money to test everyone in the ministry.

612
42:20.227 --> 42:21.440
Aren't you worried about her?

613
42:22.483 --> 42:24.240
Don't you realize that if we don't clear up these rumors soon,

614
42:24.453 --> 42:26.720
Ta will have to put up with this gossip for who knows how long?

615
42:29.301 --> 42:32.040
And frankly, this whole mess

616
42:32.325 --> 42:33.360
started because of you.

617
42:36.867 --> 42:39.250
You should be more proactive and take responsibility for it.

618
42:39.608 --> 42:41.363
You can't just act like it's none of your business.

619
42:41.454 --> 42:42.910
All right, all right!

620
42:44.024 --> 42:45.025
Approved!

621
42:50.192 --> 42:52.560
Damn, you didn't even give me time to feel guilty.

622
42:57.190 --> 42:58.191
Thank you, Uncle.

623
43:12.094 --> 43:13.095
Ta.

624
43:13.886 --> 43:15.000
I'm really sorry.

625
43:15.624 --> 43:19.000
I never imagined Nopnapha would go this crazy.

626
43:21.198 --> 43:22.760
But I haven't just been sitting around doing nothing.

627
43:23.512 --> 43:26.320
I've arranged for a mobile testing unit to come to the ministry tomorrow.

628
43:26.843 --> 43:28.640
So you can finally clear your name.

629
43:29.926 --> 43:32.040
I'll also issue an official memo to set the record straight.

630
43:32.430 --> 43:33.431
See?

631
43:35.286 --> 43:36.640
I really care about you, Ta.

632
43:39.168 --> 43:41.584
What if she spreads more lies about me?

633
43:42.464 --> 43:44.550
Will you have to keep clearing my name every time?

634
43:45.934 --> 43:47.091
And how am I supposed to live

635
43:47.992 --> 43:50.797
when everyone keeps looking down on me?

636
43:53.027 --> 43:56.840
I also warned her never to do anything like this to you again.

637
43:57.070 --> 44:00.334
Otherwise, I'll announce publicly that our marriage is in trouble.

638
44:01.272 --> 44:02.520
That's what she's most afraid of.

639
44:03.859 --> 44:07.000
But you shouldn't provoke her again, either.

640
44:08.323 --> 44:11.012
About me sitting on your desk, taking photos, and sending them to her?

641
44:15.528 --> 44:16.760
I love you, Director.

642
44:17.625 --> 44:18.726
Now that I'm back,

643
44:19.406 --> 44:21.523
I want to show that you're mine, too.

644
44:22.568 --> 44:23.569
Why?

645
44:24.211 --> 44:26.000
Is my dignity worth less than hers?

646
44:26.413 --> 44:29.680
Why do I have to hide while she gets to be out in the open?

647
44:30.230 --> 44:31.231
Or...

648
44:32.384 --> 44:33.800
Do you love me less than you love her?

649
44:33.835 --> 44:35.930
Oh, Ta. How could you say that?

650
44:37.296 --> 44:40.160
My love for you can't be measured or compared.

651
44:40.331 --> 44:41.640
Because you're the only one I love.

652
44:43.462 --> 44:45.200
As for Nopnapha, she's just

653
44:45.280 --> 44:47.881
someone I made the mistake of marrying.

654
44:52.400 --> 44:53.401
So...

655
44:54.664 --> 44:57.880
When will you divorce her and marry me, Director?

656
44:58.539 --> 44:59.760
You've given me the ring already.

657
45:04.384 --> 45:05.385
I've told you before.

658
45:06.806 --> 45:08.207
We have to wait until my children grow up.

659
45:09.307 --> 45:10.520
And when that day comes,

660
45:10.806 --> 45:14.080
I'll sign the divorce papers with Nopnapha in the morning.

661
45:14.432 --> 45:17.664
Then I'll register our marriage that very afternoon.

662
45:18.670 --> 45:19.671
Okay?

663
45:32.859 --> 45:33.860
I've told you before.

664
45:34.112 --> 45:35.440
We have to wait until my children grow up.

665
45:35.659 --> 45:36.880
And when that day comes,

666
45:36.971 --> 45:39.960
I'll sign the divorce papers with Nopnapha in the morning.

667
45:40.123 --> 45:43.000
Then I'll register our marriage that very afternoon.

668
45:44.432 --> 45:47.483
The speaker is trying to sound sincere,

669
45:47.600 --> 45:49.601
but is hiding part of the truth

670
45:49.766 --> 45:53.040
by making himself sound natural and convincing.

671
45:55.072 --> 45:57.350
You don't need AI to figure that out. Anyone can tell.

672
45:57.707 --> 45:59.400
To sum it up in one word,

673
45:59.440 --> 46:00.441
Bullshit!

674
46:00.863 --> 46:02.120
I can't believe it.

675
46:02.835 --> 46:04.880
How could my sister fall for a guy like that?

676
46:05.758 --> 46:07.500
Ta doesn't seem that stupid.

677
46:08.440 --> 46:10.360
Anyone can be a fool

678
46:10.441 --> 46:12.560
when they're blinded by love.

679
46:13.200 --> 46:14.700
You've read your sister's diary, haven't you?

680
46:16.854 --> 46:19.855
True. If I hadn't found Ta's diary,

681
46:20.294 --> 46:22.680
I'd never have known how that damn director manipulated her

682
46:22.795 --> 46:24.040
into falling so deeply in love with him.

683
46:25.792 --> 46:26.793
Listen to this.

684
46:29.651 --> 46:31.582
When I first started working here,

685
46:31.923 --> 46:34.104
I had to deal with some awful colleagues.

686
46:34.430 --> 46:36.627
But at least there were some good things, too.

687
46:37.310 --> 46:40.400
Like meeting Director Jenphop.

688
46:41.400 --> 46:43.840
You have 500,000 baht in student loan debt.

689
46:44.702 --> 46:49.200
And 3,150 baht is deducted from your salary every month.

690
46:50.000 --> 46:51.001
So...

691
46:53.976 --> 46:55.040
What's the problem?

692
46:57.699 --> 46:59.640
I'd like to request a payment deferral, Director.

693
47:00.504 --> 47:02.480
I have a lot of expenses right now.

694
47:02.718 --> 47:04.360
Once I've sorted out my financial problems,

695
47:04.451 --> 47:06.252
I'll resume making payments.

696
47:10.100 --> 47:11.101
But...

697
47:12.000 --> 47:15.520
The longer you put it off, the more interest you'll have to pay.

698
47:18.395 --> 47:19.396
I understand.

699
47:20.976 --> 47:22.360
But what else can I do?

700
47:23.787 --> 47:25.920
I really do have a lot of expenses.

701
47:29.787 --> 47:30.788
Actually,

702
47:32.059 --> 47:34.720
paying just over 3,000 baht a month isn't that much.

703
47:36.518 --> 47:38.640
I don't want you worrying about this.

704
47:39.136 --> 47:40.520
I'm afraid it might affect your work.

705
47:42.550 --> 47:44.000
How about this?

706
47:44.341 --> 47:46.502
I'll help you take care of your debt.

707
47:48.507 --> 47:49.926
What do you mean?

708
47:53.526 --> 47:55.088
I'll pay off your debt for you.

709
47:56.587 --> 47:59.046
There's something else I've learned about you.

710
47:59.678 --> 48:01.320
You're also struggling with rent

711
48:01.880 --> 48:03.400
since you had to move closer to the ministry.

712
48:03.731 --> 48:04.732
So, how about this?

713
48:05.464 --> 48:07.896
I'll help cover some of those expenses, too.

714
48:09.187 --> 48:10.720
I have a vacant condo unit.

715
48:11.480 --> 48:13.081
It's just three kilometers from here.

716
48:13.900 --> 48:15.101
You can stay there rent-free.

717
48:19.582 --> 48:22.400
- Are you sure that's okay, Director? - Of course it is.

718
48:24.998 --> 48:28.680
Taking care of your subordinates is part of a boss's job.

719
48:33.723 --> 48:34.724
Thank you so much.

720
48:38.076 --> 48:39.077
Oh, by the way.

721
48:39.473 --> 48:40.840
I've read your background.

722
48:42.016 --> 48:43.600
You've been through a lot, Mutta.

723
48:43.963 --> 48:44.964
I admire that.

724
48:47.344 --> 48:49.240
Are you free this evening?

725
48:49.750 --> 48:51.080
Why don't you join me for dinner?

726
48:51.704 --> 48:52.960
I'd like to get to know you better.

727
48:55.438 --> 48:56.440
Of course, Director.

728
48:57.614 --> 49:01.080
I thought someone who treated me so well

729
49:01.395 --> 49:03.920
was the one I could spend my life with.

730
49:13.800 --> 49:14.801
[Free Health Screening]

731
49:16.320 --> 49:18.840
Come one, come all!

732
49:18.900 --> 49:23.601
Director Jenphop has arranged for a mobile testing unit to screen everyone right here!

733
49:23.840 --> 49:25.441
So you can all have peace of mind.

734
49:25.531 --> 49:27.760
If anyone tests positive, they can get treated right away.

735
49:28.160 --> 49:30.761
Don't be shy! Come get tested!

736
49:31.238 --> 49:33.160
Everyone, while you're waiting your turn,

737
49:33.227 --> 49:35.920
I have a critical illness insurance policy to offer you.

738
49:35.974 --> 49:39.400
HPV, for example, can lead to cancer.

739
49:40.262 --> 49:44.120
Whiskey, if I undergo gender-affirming bottom surgery

740
49:44.206 --> 49:46.207
and then develop cervical cancer,

741
49:46.379 --> 49:48.240
would the policy cover that?

742
49:48.552 --> 49:50.952
Then we'd classify that as testicular cancer.

743
49:51.928 --> 49:55.040
Actually, Whiskey, you should sell a policy to Aunt Phorn.

744
49:55.067 --> 49:56.480
Uncle Sak isn't here today either.

745
49:56.500 --> 49:58.680
At their age, maybe cancer's already gotten him.

746
49:58.710 --> 50:00.600
You bitch! Watch your mouth!

747
50:01.000 --> 50:03.001
Just kidding, Auntie!

748
50:03.043 --> 50:07.120
Actually, you shouldn't even bother getting tested for STIs.

749
50:07.190 --> 50:08.650
Because I heard

750
50:08.808 --> 50:11.809
your lady parts are covered in cobwebs by now!

751
50:15.214 --> 50:16.798
How vulgar! So low-class!

752
50:17.214 --> 50:18.720
I suppose you don't need to get tested either.

753
50:18.814 --> 50:21.700
You spend all your time with Cha-am, so you probably never change partners.

754
50:22.800 --> 50:25.022
Whoa, Auntie!

755
50:25.432 --> 50:29.256
I may be straight, but I still have standards.

756
50:29.832 --> 50:31.440
I wouldn't sleep with Meow even if you paid me.

757
50:34.080 --> 50:37.000
And I wouldn't sleep with Cha-am either, Auntie.

758
50:37.040 --> 50:38.041
But come to think of it,

759
50:38.075 --> 50:39.915
with faces like yours,

760
50:40.000 --> 50:42.360
nobody would want either of you unless you slept with each other!

761
50:44.056 --> 50:45.920
Go on! Get out of the line!

762
50:45.957 --> 50:47.480
You're nothing but bad luck!

763
50:47.624 --> 50:49.825
You're in the way! So vulgar and low-class! Get lost!

764
50:50.200 --> 50:51.619
Come on, Auntie!

765
50:52.296 --> 50:55.480
Just because you're old doesn't mean you can insult everyone!

766
50:56.392 --> 50:57.880
I won't just take your insults!

767
50:57.960 --> 51:00.120
- Come on! I'm serious! - Cha-am, go get her!

768
51:00.160 --> 51:01.700
- Oh, I'm so scared! - Punch her in the face!

769
51:02.264 --> 51:04.840
Is that even a person? I never would've guessed.

770
51:04.902 --> 51:06.203
I thought it was a rat snake.

771
51:10.278 --> 51:12.635
You old hag! You've gone too far too many times.

772
51:14.083 --> 51:15.120
Why the hell did you slap me?

773
51:19.971 --> 51:20.972
What's going on here?

774
51:22.000 --> 51:23.566
Stop it! Stop!

775
51:28.843 --> 51:31.718
Stop it!

776
51:36.123 --> 51:37.124
Stop, please.

777
51:38.419 --> 51:39.800
Please don't fight.

778
51:40.414 --> 51:42.320
Violence is never the answer.

779
51:42.904 --> 51:43.905
Fine!

780
51:44.862 --> 51:45.863
Hey! What the hell?

781
51:48.288 --> 51:49.600
Why did you hit her?

782
51:50.539 --> 51:52.560
Phorn, you're old enough to know better!

783
51:53.835 --> 51:55.240
Why resort to violence?

784
51:57.427 --> 51:59.360
What's wrong with you people? Can't you listen?

785
52:00.685 --> 52:02.960
We all work together! Why are you fighting?

786
52:09.824 --> 52:10.825
The test results are in.

787
52:11.414 --> 52:14.720
Syphilis, gonorrhea, HPV, and HIV. All negative.

788
52:15.215 --> 52:17.720
Whoever's trying to frame me like this, stop it.

789
52:18.055 --> 52:19.056
It's pathetic.

790
52:19.094 --> 52:20.095
- We know! - We know!

791
52:23.814 --> 52:25.160
You're still at it?

792
52:25.736 --> 52:26.737
Stop it!

793
52:28.192 --> 52:29.193
Hey, Phorn!

794
52:32.747 --> 52:33.748
Stop it right now!

795
52:35.334 --> 52:37.840
Whoever's trying to frame me like this, stop it.

796
52:38.240 --> 52:39.241
It's pathetic.

797
52:39.419 --> 52:42.760
Does she seriously not care that she's been exposed for having gonorrhea?

798
52:43.115 --> 52:44.116
Exactly!

799
52:44.587 --> 52:47.500
She doesn't even care about all the gossip.

800
52:48.400 --> 52:50.901
We even voted to make her resign.

801
52:51.235 --> 52:52.880
But she just said...

802
52:54.286 --> 52:55.520
I'm sorry.

803
52:57.144 --> 52:59.850
"I'm not leaving! How the hell am I supposed to make a living if I do?"

804
53:00.664 --> 53:02.010
That's exactly what she said.

805
53:04.648 --> 53:07.360
And now that they brought in a mobile testing unit,

806
53:07.523 --> 53:11.416
and her results came back negative, nobody's gossiping about it anymore.

807
53:59.500 --> 54:01.640
Here, take this. Keep the change.

808
54:04.558 --> 54:05.960
Thank you so much, ma'am.

809
54:07.890 --> 54:09.100
Keep me updated if you hear anything else.

810
54:10.000 --> 54:11.001
Yes, ma'am.

811
54:16.158 --> 54:17.159
[Bitch!]

812
54:20.589 --> 54:22.600
Director Jenphop has issued another official memo, ma'am.

813
54:25.891 --> 54:26.892
What does it say?

814
54:29.582 --> 54:32.400
He condemns the disclosure of Mutta's medical information.

815
54:32.942 --> 54:34.968
He says false information was used to maliciously target her.

816
54:35.070 --> 54:36.271
And that it's a criminal offense.

817
54:36.500 --> 54:38.760
He also attached Mutta's latest test results.

818
54:39.000 --> 54:40.001
They came back negative, ma'am.

819
54:40.600 --> 54:43.120
But Mutta really did have gonorrhea before.

820
54:43.638 --> 54:46.400
I got the information straight from her medical records, ma'am.

821
54:48.731 --> 54:50.608
But you told Phop about it, didn't you?

822
54:50.800 --> 54:52.401
Do you know he came and yelled at me?

823
54:52.411 --> 54:55.040
Oh, no! I didn't tell Mr. Jenphop!

824
54:55.200 --> 54:57.080
I told Veekit.

825
54:57.147 --> 54:59.000
And Veekit told Mr. Jenphop.

826
54:59.800 --> 55:01.371
It's the same damn thing!

827
55:03.779 --> 55:05.520
How am I supposed to trust you with anything now?

828
55:05.696 --> 55:08.200
One little flirtation from a man, and you spill everything.

829
55:10.814 --> 55:13.560
Please don't get upset, ma'am.

830
55:13.815 --> 55:17.040
Let's come up with another plan to deal with Mutta.

831
55:17.928 --> 55:20.782
Ma'am, the last paragraph says,

832
55:21.432 --> 55:24.920
While physical illnesses can be cured,

833
55:25.462 --> 55:28.320
those who bully and harass others

834
55:28.560 --> 55:29.761
must change their behavior immediately,

835
55:30.091 --> 55:31.702
as such conduct constitutes a serious disciplinary offense

836
55:32.000 --> 55:34.440
and will be punished to the fullest extent.

837
55:36.278 --> 55:40.145
A department director threatening a minister? Am I supposed to be scared?

838
55:40.483 --> 55:41.920
From now on,

839
55:42.307 --> 55:44.443
I won't attend any public events with you.

840
55:45.278 --> 55:47.211
And I'll announce to the media

841
55:47.760 --> 55:51.000
that you and I are no longer husband and wife.

842
55:59.800 --> 56:00.801
Oshi!

843
56:04.120 --> 56:06.121
What am I going to do about that bitch?

844
56:16.576 --> 56:18.480
Ever since the new memo came out

845
56:18.707 --> 56:20.704
along with Ta's test results,

846
56:20.875 --> 56:22.667
people have finally stopped staring at us.

847
56:23.900 --> 56:26.040
Then you don't have to walk with me anymore, Kit.

848
56:26.250 --> 56:28.640
My two friends are back to walking with me now.

849
56:29.078 --> 56:31.400
Oh, come on, Ta!

850
56:31.500 --> 56:34.201
Kit can still walk with us.

851
56:34.280 --> 56:35.840
The more friends, the merrier.

852
56:35.984 --> 56:38.040
We're all besties here.

853
56:41.979 --> 56:44.900
Oh! What are the police doing here?

854
56:49.184 --> 56:52.000
She seems awfully proud of the ring Phop gave her.

855
56:56.163 --> 56:58.640
When there should only be one ring like it,

856
57:00.622 --> 57:02.360
and it should be on my finger.

857
57:04.323 --> 57:06.124
Then let's use that ring

858
57:06.904 --> 57:07.905
to hurt her.

859
57:09.500 --> 57:12.720
Make her suffer so much she'll never dare wear it again.

860
57:18.600 --> 57:19.601
Hello.

861
57:20.601 --> 57:22.300
You're Mutta Jongsawat, correct?

862
57:23.446 --> 57:24.447
Yes.

863
57:24.672 --> 57:25.673
Good.

864
57:28.515 --> 57:30.840
Touch, call the police inspector for me.

865
57:32.216 --> 57:34.040
I'll teach that bitch a lesson.

866
57:34.376 --> 57:35.960
A pathetic mistress like her

867
57:36.680 --> 57:38.081
has messed with the wrong woman.

868
57:38.800 --> 57:39.801
Yes, ma'am.

869
57:47.374 --> 57:49.560
May I see both your hands, please?

870
57:54.131 --> 57:55.320
Officer, is something wrong?

871
57:55.544 --> 57:57.600
You've been accused of stealing this ring.

872
57:58.323 --> 58:01.200
That's an offense under Section 334 of the Criminal Code.

873
58:02.046 --> 58:03.280
Please come with us to the police station.

874
58:03.939 --> 58:06.760
Hong, aren't they two different rings?

875
58:07.040 --> 58:08.441
Remember when they fought outside the ministry?

876
58:08.600 --> 58:10.601
It was because Ta had a ring just like hers.

877
58:12.848 --> 58:15.819
Then would you dare testify for Ta, Whiskey?

878
58:45.184 --> 58:48.480
Ms. Nopnapha's asset declaration

879
58:48.571 --> 58:50.600
clearly specifies the details of the ring.

880
58:51.083 --> 58:52.360
And this is the diamond certificate.

881
58:52.944 --> 58:53.945
What about yours?

882
58:54.432 --> 58:56.440
How could you bully her like that?

883
58:56.656 --> 58:58.651
Ta is just a petite woman, Nopnapha!

884
58:58.720 --> 59:00.240
Don't you dare! Hey!

885
59:00.550 --> 59:02.880
You think you're the only one who can go crazy? I can be crazy too!

886
59:04.982 --> 59:07.000
Then let's keep living like this, damn it!

887
59:07.500 --> 59:09.640
Director, please calm down.

888
59:09.688 --> 59:10.689
I've missed you so much, Ta.

889
59:11.500 --> 59:13.100
I'm going to give it to you good today.

890
59:14.318 --> 59:15.480
Just to make things more exciting.

891
59:16.840 --> 59:20.080
Wait for me, Director.

892
59:22.192 --> 59:25.280
This is going to be so much fun, Nopnapha will scream!
